================================================================
Third-party components bundled or required at runtime
================================================================

H2Orestart (vendor/H2Orestart-v0.7.12.oxt)
  Homepage: https://github.com/ebandal/H2Orestart
  License:  GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 or later (LGPL-2.1+)
  Purpose:  LibreOffice extension that adds HWP/HWPX import filters,
            used by scripts/hwp2x.sh for the actual document conversion.
  The full LGPL text and source are available at the project homepage.
  Users may replace this bundled binary with a modified version of
  H2Orestart at any time (drop a new .oxt into vendor/ and re-run
  `unopkg add`).

LibreOffice
  Homepage: https://www.libreoffice.org/
  License:  Mozilla Public License v2.0
  Purpose:  Headless document conversion engine. Installed by the user,
            not bundled.

OpenJDK
  Homepage: https://openjdk.org/
  License:  GPL-2.0-with-classpath-exception
  Purpose:  Java runtime required by H2Orestart. Installed by the user,
            not bundled.

Slack Bolt for Python
  Homepage: https://github.com/SlackAPI/bolt-python
  License:  MIT
  Purpose:  Slack app framework. Installed as a Python dependency.

python-dotenv
  Homepage: https://github.com/theskumar/python-dotenv
  License:  BSD-3-Clause
  Purpose:  Loads tokens from .env at startup. Installed as a Python dependency.

================================================================
Sample documents (samples/)
================================================================

The sample HWP/HWPX files under samples/ originate from publicly
released Jeju Provincial Government policy documents (Jeju
Provincial Office, Policy Planning Office). They are included for
conversion-fidelity testing on real-world government formatting and
may be replaced with user-provided test fixtures at any time.
